# C30H32NO2F15 | Geometry Optimization + Freq | wb97x-d3 def2-tzvpd/CPCM(SMD:Water)
# C8O2F15 | Frequencies | wB97X-D3/ma-def2-TZVP
# 
! r2scan-3c DefGrid3 Freq CPCM

